+| --- | ---: |
+| Environment import | 11.40 |
+| Macro invocation, including unscoped demand work | 10.09 |
+| Import `&form` | 3.20 |
+| Import explicit arguments again | 2.68 |
+| Export expanded forms | 2.70 |
+| Emit namespace registrations | 3.99 |
